(a) Pin the 33 files individually in FROZEN (rev14 "per-file pins").
(b) Record per-fixture sha256 in the corpus record and add a preflight binding check.
(c) Have run_acceptance.py verify each fixture against the pinned corpus manifest deterministically (or simply regenerate fixtures at preflight and compare byte-for-byte).

